WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.916
How to <b>change a price</b> or <b>add stock</b>

00:00:03.982 --> 00:00:06.971
To change the price, tap it in the table

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:11.401
Type the new one and press Enter: it saves right away

00:00:11.453 --> 00:00:13.803
For everything else, open <b>Editar</b> (edit)

00:00:13.939 --> 00:00:18.529
New stock arrived? Type how many and MiCaja adds them up

00:00:18.595 --> 00:00:21.987
Save, and your inventory is up to date
